WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Grace Liu: Line 2 OEE came in at seventy-one percent, availability losses are still the biggest driver.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Theo Marsh: Is that still mostly changeover time, or something new?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Grace Liu: Mostly changeover, though we had one unplanned gearbox stoppage mid-month.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Carlos Ibarra: The changeover SOP rollout should help once Line 2 adopts the updated sequence next month.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Theo Marsh: Let's track changeover time weekly once that rolls out so we can see the impact directly.
